### Necessário para pegar o token
### Post
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "girl",
    "password": "girl"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de inserção de alocado (animalidifk e piqueteidfk precisam existir)
POST http://localhost:40000/insertAlocado HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "animalidifk": 1,
    "piqueteidfk": 1,
    "datainicio": "2026-06-01",
    "datafinal": "2026-06-10",
    "removido": false
}

### teste de buscar todos os alocados
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllAlocado HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar alocado por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getAlocadoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de atualizar o alocado
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateAlocado/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "animalidifk": 1,
    "piqueteidfk": 2,
    "datainicio": "2026-06-11",
    "datafinal": "2026-06-20",
    "removido": false
}

### teste de remover (soft delete) o alocado
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteAlocado/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
